00:02:02.290 --> 00:02:05.420
For the first week you're
gonna dump a lot of water

00:02:05.420 --> 00:02:06.930
and some fat but after that,

00:02:06.930 --> 00:02:09.260
it's gonna be more and more fat.

00:02:09.260 --> 00:02:13.140
You're gonna be surprised how
much fluid you were retaining.

00:02:13.140 --> 00:02:15.380
Some people within one week can lose

00:02:15.380 --> 00:02:17.490
about 13 pounds of fluid.

00:02:17.490 --> 00:02:18.910
They're holding that fluid around

00:02:18.910 --> 00:02:20.990
